# Errors. Calls while closed; open twice; bad tracks, channels,
# pitches, durations (a duration under one tick is rejected wherever
# it falls; exactly one tick, 1/2520, is accepted); run_to while
# stopped returns at once instead of hanging; a port name that isn't
# one on any platform (Phase 3/6: whether a port exists is covered by
# check_device on Linux, and by hand on Windows); test calls on a
# device.
track 1 60:1
  error: SEQ_ERR_NOT_OPEN (sequencer not open)
play continue
  error: SEQ_ERR_NOT_OPEN (sequencer not open)
tempo
  error: SEQ_ERR_NOT_OPEN (sequencer not open)
tempo 100
  error: SEQ_ERR_NOT_OPEN (sequencer not open)
mute 1 = 1
